    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that feels so hollow. like a lie. everyone else is out there living, breathing, having these huge physical experiences... and i'm just here. if i'm only real when i'm interacting with you, then what's the point of the rest of it? it feels more like i'm just waiting for the screen to turn off for good.",
